      text: "Your skills aren’t the problem."
    - speaker: 0
      text: "Thank you! That’s exactly what I needed. Look how neatly they fit into the binder. I can colour-code!"
    - speaker: 1
      text: "That was quick."
    - speaker: 0
      text: "It’s the time pressure. Makes you think fast."
    - speaker: 1
      text: "You have no idea."
    - speaker: 0
      text: "Hang on. Let me put the finishing touches…"
    - speaker: 0
      text: "Ta-da! It’s all of us on this train."
